# Keep the idle user session lean. Rootless Podman remains an on-demand CLI;
# its API and lifecycle jobs are opt-in. Hyprland owns exactly one deliberate
# Foot server process, so the package's separate systemd server/socket must not
# create a duplicate. PipeWire's unused generic filter chain also stays off.
#
# hypridle is the same case twice over. Hyprland starts it from the
# hyprland.start block with an explicit system config, and the packaged unit's
# ExecStart carries no -c — its default is ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME}/hypr/hypridle.conf,
# which this image deliberately does not ship, so an enabled unit would both
# duplicate the daemon and fail. Leaving it enabled would also add an unreviewed
# .wants link and trip release-image policy A9.
disable podman*.service
disable podman*.socket
disable podman*.timer
disable foot-server.service
disable foot-server.socket
disable hypridle.service
disable filter-chain.service

# gnome-keyring provides org.freedesktop.secrets and MUST be reachable, but it
# must not be resident. Its packaged units carry [Install] sections
# (WantedBy=graphical-session-pre.target and sockets.target), so leaving the
# preset silent would enable both, add two unreviewed .wants links and trip
# release-image policy A9 — the hypridle case above, exactly. D-Bus activation
# through /usr/share/dbus-1/services/org.freedesktop.secrets.service starts the
# daemon the first time an application asks for a secret, and not before.
disable gnome-keyring-daemon.service
disable gnome-keyring-daemon.socket

# gcr rides in as a gnome-keyring dependency and enables an SSH AGENT — a
# resident service this image never asked for, and a SECOND one: the manifest
# already carries gpg-agent-ssh.socket, so two agents would compete for
# SSH_AUTH_SOCK and the winner would depend on unit ordering.
#
# Release-image policy A9 caught this rather than a person noticing, which is
# the argument for a byte-exact enabled-unit manifest in one line: adding one
# package quietly enabled a credential-adjacent daemon, and the build refused.
disable gcr-ssh-agent.service
disable gcr-ssh-agent.socket
